# What goes into the .vsix.
#
# node_modules is NOT listed here, and that is deliberate. vsce bundles the
# `dependencies` from package.json and prunes the devDependencies itself; naming
# node_modules here overrides that and ships an extension that cannot
# require('vscode-languageclient'). The first version of this file did exactly
# that: a 10 KB vsix with no runtime dependency in it, which fails on activation
# with a module-not-found.
#
# `dependencies` and not devDependencies is the half that matters: vscode-
# languageclient is needed when the extension RUNS.
src/**
tsconfig.json
**/*.map
**/*.ts
.gitignore
.vscodeignore
